{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00215","headline":"春游曲 · 文德皇后","name":"春游曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑桃花朝日明，兰闺艳妾动春情。\n井上新桃偷面色，檐边嫩柳学身轻。\n花中来去看舞蝶，树上长短听啼莺。\n林下何须远借问，出衆风流旧有名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文德皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}